<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3471" root="بهو" body-key="b">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>Possessing the quality,</i> or <i>attribute, of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهَآء</span>
[i. e. <i>beauty,</i> or <i>goodliness,</i> &amp;c.]; (JK, S, Msb;)
<i>the beauty of which,</i> (JK,) or <i>the pleasing appearance of which,</i> (TA,) <i>satisfies the eye;</i> (JK,
TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهٍ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَاهٍ</span></b> : the fem. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهِىٌّ</span> is
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهِيَّةٌ</span>; of which the pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهِيَّاتٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهَايَا</span>: and the
fem. of ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهٍ</span></b>  is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَهِيَةٌ</span>; and the pl. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْهِيَآءُ</span>. (TA.)

